const prose=[
`I was going to do something extraordinary today.\nI hadn’t decided what, exactly. That was the small, unimportant part.\n\nThen the light caught the grass, and for a moment everything looked like it was made of me. Or maybe I was made of it.\n\nDon’t tell anyone I spent the morning looking. I’m calling it research.`,
`I said I’d find you something better. You looked at me as if a promise were just another thing I’d drop.\n\nFair enough. I drop a lot of things.\n\nBut I keep thinking about you out there after everyone else has gone inside. There must be something in this enormous world that needs the two of us.\n\nLet me keep looking.`,
`Everyone notices when I can do something I couldn’t do before. They look relieved. I try to look relieved, too.\n\nIt’s harder to explain the other part. The little pause where a familiar thought should be. A space so small I almost convince myself it was always there.\n\nTomorrow I’ll try again. Tonight, I’d like to remember what I was trying for.`];
